  "method": "compare_folders no longer repeats its four-way loader dispatch inline; it resolves it once through _side_loader_fn(). That is a pure extraction, so it is PROVED on real statewide data rather than asserted. Each family's real cross-environment comparison (2026-07-09 vs 2026-07-23 ssor-prod) is generated twice in separate processes - once against `git show <base>:scripts/compare_env.py` placed first on sys.path, once against the head - in mode='both', and both twins are digested cell for cell. `base_had_preflight_helper=false` / `head_had_preflight_helper=true` proves the two processes really did run different code.",
